    "The two halves matter separately because they have different remedies: a fabricated name is caught by resolving symbols before writing them, a deleted one only by a resolver that reruns. ",

    "Either way a reader applying this entry's own recognition rule grepped for a match that was not there. ",

    "That is §3's stale-citation class sitting inside the authority that names it, and it is recorded here rather than quietly deleted because a specimen whose symbols cannot be resolved is the failure this row exists to teach, one level up. ",

    "**What landed is stronger than descending**, and the difference is the reusable part: the remedy vocabulary was hoisted into a module that names no format — `gunbc.scm.load_standing` `LoadStanding`, and each format now classifies its own refusals into it (`gunbc.scm.commit_closure_json_v2` `closure_document_load_standing`). ",

    "Descending inside one codec's enum would have closed the collapse and left the consumer still matching on a format's vocabulary; hoisting leaves the consumer no format arms to collapse, so the next format is a new classifier rather than a new way to reintroduce this defect. ",

